2. 登录并创建库和用户（密码请换成强密码，下面只是示例）：
```
sudo mysql
CREATE DATABASE shopdb CHARACTER SET utf8mb4 COLLATE utf8mb4_0900_ai_ci;
CREATE USER 'shop_user'@'10.0.0.5' IDENTIFIED BY 'Str0ng#Pass2026';
GRANT SELECT, INSERT, UPDATE, DELETE ON shopdb.* TO 'shop_user'@'10.0.0.5';
FLUSH PRIVILEGES;
```
这里只授予了增删改查权限，并且限定只能从 10.0.0.5 连接，比 '%' 安全得多。
